# @vbotbuildovich on a line enables Owner Merge there (DEVPROD-5038):
# .github/workflows/owner-merge.yml approves a PR as that bot when the
# author is in the owning team for every path the PR touches. Lines
# without the bot always need a human approval from the listed owner.
#
# Last match wins, so the catch-all comes first. Keep patterns to `*`
# or anchored (leading /) exact files and directory prefixes ending in
# /: the workflow approves nothing if it meets any other form.

* @redpanda-data/documentation @vbotbuildovich

# CI, automation, and this file always need a second docs reviewer.
/.github/ @redpanda-data/documentation

# npm release and publish configuration always needs a second docs
# reviewer.
/package.json                  @redpanda-data/documentation
/package-lock.json             @redpanda-data/documentation
/.npmignore                    @redpanda-data/documentation
/release-please-config.json    @redpanda-data/documentation
/.release-please-manifest.json @redpanda-data/documentation
